Feature: Mission files
  Save the plan to a file to keep it. Load the file later, for example to fly the same
  circuit again at the field. In Mission Planner, these are Save WP File and Load WP File.

  Expectation: Saving keeps the plan in a file
    Given the plan has at least 1 item
    When the operator saves the plan to a file
    Then the mission file is up to date

  Expectation: Changing the plan after saving
    Given the mission file is up to date
    And the map tool is PLAN
    When the operator clicks the map
    Then the mission file is out of date

  Expectation: Loading brings the saved plan back
    Given the mission file is out of date
    When the operator loads the plan from the file
    Then the mission file is up to date

  Expectation: Before a save, there is nothing to load
    Given the mission file is missing
    When the operator loads the plan from the file
    Then the plan stays the same
